<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Normative basis: ISO/IEC 22989:2022.\r\n\r\nThree views: the system with its components, functions and tasks, the algorithms, models and parameters, and the data with the processes acting on them.\r\n\r\nEvery definition carries a German wording alongside its English translation.\r\n\r\nScope: the AI system with its life cycle, the machine learning model with its data, and the tasks a model addresses. The qualities of clause 3.5 with their values, controllability and risk are not covered."@en .
